<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#111518">
  <title>水位 × 大盤｜Kelvin Wiggly Morning Brief</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@700;900&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/water-level.css?v=1">
  <script id="water-comparison-data" type="application/json">{{ comparison | tojson }}</script>
  <script defer src="assets/js/water-level.js?v=1"></script>
</head>
<body>
<header class="masthead"><div class="container masthead-inner">
  <a class="brand" href="index.html"><span class="kw-mark">K</span> KELVIN WIGGLY</a>
  <nav aria-label="主要導覽"><a href="index.html">首頁</a><a href="{{ latest_brief_url }}">最新晨報 ↗</a></nav>
</div></header>
<main class="container">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">ARK WATER LEVEL / TAIEX</p>
    <h1>水位，與大盤的距離。</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">把方舟持股水位與台股加權指數放在同一條時間軸，觀察同步與分歧。</p>
  </header>
  <section class="metrics" aria-label="最新資料">
    <article class="metric water"><h2><i></i>最新方舟水位</h2><p class="metric-value">{{ latest.water_level }}<small>%</small></p><p class="metric-note">{{ latest.date_display }} · {{ latest.scenario_label }}</p></article>
    <article class="metric market"><h2><i></i>加權指數收盤</h2><p class="metric-value" id="latest-index">—</p><p class="metric-note" id="latest-index-date">尚無可比對收盤資料</p></article>
    <article class="metric comparison"><h2>所選區間・同日期比對</h2><p class="period-values"><span id="period-water">—</span><span id="period-market">—</span></p><p class="metric-note" id="period-dates">以首末兩個共同有值的日期計算</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="chart-panel" aria-labelledby="chart-heading">
    <div class="chart-toolbar"><div><p class="eyebrow">TWO SERIES. ONE TIMELINE.</p><h2 id="chart-heading">水位 × 台股加權指數</h2></div>
      <div class="range-buttons" role="group" aria-label="顯示期間"><button type="button" data-range="30" aria-pressed="false">近 1 月</button><button type="button" data-range="90" aria-pressed="true">近 3 月</button><button type="button" data-range="all" aria-pressed="false">全部</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="legend"><span class="water-key">方舟水位 % <small>左軸 0–100</small></span><span class="market-key">加權指數 <small>右軸・點</small></span></div>
    <div id="chart-shell"><svg id="water-chart" role="img" tabindex="0" aria-label="水位與加權指數雙軸線圖。使用左右方向鍵逐日查看。"></svg><p id="chart-empty" hidden>目前沒有可繪製的水位紀錄。</p></div>
    <div class="chart-readout" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><strong id="selected-date">—</strong><span class="water-text" id="selected-water">水位 —</span><span class="market-text" id="selected-market">加權 —</span></div>
    <div class="date-control"><label for="chart-date">逐日查看</label><input id="chart-date" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0" aria-label="線圖日期"><span>點選線圖或拖曳</span></div>
    <p class="chart-note" id="coverage-note"></p>
    <p class="chart-note">兩軸單位不同，線條交叉不代表買賣訊號。水位上升＝市場健康度／可部署空間增加；下降＝轉弱、宜審慎。這不是投資績效曲線。</p>
    <noscript><p class="chart-note">請啟用 JavaScript 查看互動線圖；下方仍可展開完整逐日明細。</p></noscript>
  </section>
  <details class="archive"><summary><span>逐日明細</span><small>{{ records | length }} 筆水位紀錄</small></summary>
    <div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="逐日水位與加權指數明細">
      <table><thead><tr><th scope="col">日期</th><th scope="col">方舟水位</th><th scope="col">加權收盤</th><th scope="col">晨報情境</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        {% for row in records %}<tr><th scope="row">{{ row.date_display }}</th><td class="water-text">{{ row.water_level }}%</td><td class="market-text">{% if row.taiex_close is not none %}{{ '{:,.2f}'.format(row.taiex_close) }}{% else %}{{ row.market_label }}{% endif %}</td><td>{{ row.scenario_label }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table>
    </div>
  </details>
  <footer><p>方舟運算持股水位紀錄 · TWSE 臺灣證券交易所加權指數日收盤</p><p>水位為晨報當日紀錄，大盤為同日收盤，並非同一時刻快照；僅比較走勢，不推定領先、因果或策略報酬。缺值不補線、未收盤不冒充收盤。</p><a href="{{ latest_brief_url }}">返回最新晨報 ↗</a></footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
